  "description": "Stocks I am in or watching 👀 Last Update: 27 January 2025",
  "body_html": "<p>This document will be updated at least weekly, you can see the “Last Update” in the subtitle. <em><strong>Changes will be</strong></em> <em><strong>Bold and Italicized</strong></em>. Stocks will be labeled: “In 📈” if I bought or shorted, or “watching 👀” if they are just on my radar. Each stock will be labeled with entry price/range and stop price/range. Additionally, these will be noted, a brief summary, for WHY I like them or dislike them. Note that many of my charts and stocks are based off the weekly, as this timeframe allows people time to make decisions on their own. There will be NO DAY TRADES ❌</p><p>Be cognizant that NO ONE can get every stock right…some of these WILL be losers. Risk management is a MUST. Do not come crying to me if something goes against us, it is just the nature of the markets and it is why stops and bracket orders are available. Questions are welcome in the chat, officially Monday to Thursday mornings (though I am in the chat far more often). </p><p>General Market Update: Large cap stocks are largely over inflated in my opinion, particularly NVDA. I personally believe we are at the tail end of the bull market. I closed most of my positions December 20th after the FOMC crash, as I took that as a warning signal. Small caps and mid caps though, have not ran, and typically perform best at the tail end of bull markets, hence I have been opening some smaller positions. I do believe a melt down…a large scale drop, in the markets is coming…but we may have a blow off top before that happens. Timing that blow off top…up or down…is incredibly difficult, and thus I wont even try. It has been a good 3 years and I don’t want to lose the gains made.</p><p>This video explains how I, often…not always… search for stocks:  </p><div id=\"tiktok-iframe?media=1&amp;app=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40economyandstocks%2Fvideo%2F7445689568289983786&amp;key=e27c740634285c9ddc20db64f73358dd\" class=\"tiktok-wrap outer player\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@economyandstocks/video/7445689568289983786&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Replying to @James Abbe The best stocks 2025 and how to find the stocks to buy for 2025 🎯 #stockstobuy #stockstowatch #investingforbeginners #tipsandtricks  Legal Disclaimer: Unauthorized use of this video, including by any media entity or individual, without express written permission is strictly prohibited. By using or reproducing this content in any form, you and your associated organization agree to a licensing fee of $250,000 per use and reimbursement for any and all legal fees associated.&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c7a4c0ff-6825-4f55-8cd1-cdd06dbf9313_1080x1920.jpeg&quot;,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;Timothy James&quot;,&quot;embed_url&quot;:&quot;https://cdn.iframe.ly/api/iframe?media=1&amp;app=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40economyandstocks%2Fvideo%2F7445689568289983786&amp;key=e27c740634285c9ddc20db64f73358dd&quot;,&quot;author_url&quot;:&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@economyandstocks&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"TikTokCreateTikTokEmbed\"><iframe id=\"iframe-tiktok-iframe?media=1&amp;app=1&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40economyandstocks%2Fvideo%2F7445689568289983786&amp;key=e27c740634285c9ddc20db64f73358dd\" class=\"tiktok-iframe visible\" src=\"https://www.tiktok.com/player/v1/7445689568289983786\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"fullscreen; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen=\"\" scrolling=\"no\"></iframe></div><p>⬇️ Positions and Watchlist below this line ⬇️</p>",
